msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Beyond that fence is West Park⑬otherwise known as Purgatory. Lot of "
"homeless folk lived there up until recently, myself included."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"But then we were all kicked out by Majima Construction. They said they were "
"going to build something called Kamurocho Hills."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "I thought the construction of Kamurocho Hills was canceled."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"That's right. I thought maybe I could move back inside, so I snuck into the "
"park, but there's no one there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Nobody at all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Well, I definitely wouldn't stick around. Too spooky. I wonder where all of "
"the construction workers went."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Homeless Man"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""